"%(counter)s lines skipped: no Cosmic Signature or Cosmic Anomaly of an "
"English client (ships, structures, other client languages)."
msgstr[0] ""
"已跳过 %(counter)s 行：不是英文客户端的 Cosmic Signature 或 Cosmic Anomaly（舰船、建筑、其他客户端语言）。"

