#: tracking.py:70
msgid ""
"This character cannot be tracked: it is not yours or has no token with the "
"location scope."
msgstr "无法追踪此角色：它不属于你，或没有带位置权限范围的令牌。"

#: tracking.py:87
msgid ""
"The token of this character is no longer valid. Add the character again with"
